1. e4 c5 { Welcome everyone to the Sicilian! This was based off of Starting Out: The Sicilian which is great for anyone looking to add this to their e4 defense repertoire.
The Sicilian is THE MOST popular defense against e4 and we'll be looking at the Open and Closed variations. There is a lot of theory at the highest level of play but just by understanding the thematic ideas and motifs you'll be able to start playing the Sicilian to great success. If you learn something or enjoy this study, feel free to leave a heart. Feel free to check out my other studies too and have a nice day (: } *


